<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Keep Going</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      color: #f5efe6;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom, #5a1a0a 0%, #1a0703 55%, #0a0302 100%);
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: normal;
      line-height: 1.2;
      max-width: 16ch;
      text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 110, 40, 0.35);
    }
    h1 em { color: #ff8a3d; font-style: italic; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>“If you’re going through <em>hell</em>, keep going.”</h1>
</body>
</html>
